  "inputHtml": "<!-- {\"url\":\"https://publish.example.com/help/callouts\"} -->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>Callouts - Example Help</title>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Example Help\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"theme-light\">\n<div class=\"published-container\">\n\t<div class=\"site-body\">\n\t\t<div class=\"site-body-left-column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"nav-view-outer\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"nav-view\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tree-item is-collapsed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tree-item-self is-clickable\"><a href=\"/help/getting-started\">Getting started</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"site-body-center-column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"render-container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"render-container-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"publish-renderer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"markdown-preview-view markdown-rendered\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"markdown-preview-sizer markdown-preview-section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mod-header mod-ui\"><h1 class=\"page-header\">Callouts</h1></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-p\"><p>To create a callout, add <code>[!info]</code> to the first line of a blockquote.</p></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Code block with Prism syntax highlighting and data-line attribute -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-pre\"><pre class=\"language-markdown\"><code data-line=\"0\" class=\"language-markdown is-loaded\"><span class=\"token blockquote punctuation\">&gt;</span> [!info] A callout title\n<span class=\"token blockquote punctuation\">&gt;</span> Here is the callout <span class=\"token bold\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">**</span><span class=\"token content\">body</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">**</span></span> content.\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Rendered non-collapsed callout -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-div\"><div data-callout-metadata=\"\" data-callout-fold=\"\" data-callout=\"info\" class=\"callout\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-info\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">A callout title</div></div><div class=\"callout-content\"><p dir=\"auto\">Here is the callout <strong>body</strong> content.</p></div></div></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Foldable collapsed callout -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-h3\"><h3>Foldable callouts</h3></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-p\"><p>A minus sign collapses the callout.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-pre\"><pre class=\"language-markdown\"><code data-line=\"0\" class=\"language-markdown is-loaded\"><span class=\"token blockquote punctuation\">&gt;</span> [!faq]- Is this foldable?\n<span class=\"token blockquote punctuation\">&gt;</span> Yes, the content is hidden when collapsed.\n</code></pre></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-div\"><div data-callout-metadata=\"\" data-callout-fold=\"-\" data-callout=\"faq\" class=\"callout is-collapsible is-collapsed\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-help-circle\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">Is this foldable?</div><div class=\"callout-fold is-collapsed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon right-triangle\"><path d=\"M3 8L12 17L21 8\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"callout-content\" style=\"display: none;\"><p dir=\"auto\">Yes, the content is hidden when collapsed.</p></div></div></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Supported types section with HRs between collapsed callouts -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-h3\"><h3>Supported types</h3></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-p\"><p>Each type has a different color and icon.</p></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Note callout (not collapsed) -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-div\"><div data-callout-metadata=\"\" data-callout-fold=\"\" data-callout=\"note\" class=\"callout\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-pencil\"><path d=\"M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">Note</div></div><div class=\"callout-content\">\n<pre class=\"language-md\"><code data-line=\"1\" class=\"language-md is-loaded\"><span class=\"token blockquote punctuation\">&gt;</span> [!note]\n<span class=\"token blockquote punctuation\">&gt;</span> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n</code></pre>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-hr\"><hr></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Abstract callout (collapsed) -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-div\"><div data-callout-metadata=\"\" data-callout-fold=\"-\" data-callout=\"abstract\" class=\"callout is-collapsible is-collapsed\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-clipboard-list\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"2\" width=\"8\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">Abstract</div><div class=\"callout-fold is-collapsed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon right-triangle\"><path d=\"M3 8L12 17L21 8\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"callout-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<pre class=\"language-md\"><code data-line=\"1\" class=\"language-md is-loaded\"><span class=\"token blockquote punctuation\">&gt;</span> [!abstract]\n<span class=\"token blockquote punctuation\">&gt;</span> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n</code></pre>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-p\"><p>Aliases: <code>summary</code>, <code>tldr</code></p></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-hr\"><hr></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Tip callout (collapsed) -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-div\"><div data-callout-metadata=\"\" data-callout-fold=\"-\" data-callout=\"tip\" class=\"callout is-collapsible is-collapsed\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-flame\"><path d=\"M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.072-2.143-.224-4.054 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.153.433-2.294 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">Tip</div><div class=\"callout-fold is-collapsed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon right-triangle\"><path d=\"M3 8L12 17L21 8\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"callout-content\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<pre class=\"language-md\"><code data-line=\"1\" class=\"language-md is-loaded\"><span class=\"token blockquote punctuation\">&gt;</span> [!tip]\n<span class=\"token blockquote punctuation\">&gt;</span> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n</code></pre>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-p\"><p>Aliases: <code>hint</code>, <code>important</code></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
